   531	def run(args):
   532	    """Evaluate one checkpoint over the pinned manifest at every angle of the grid.
   533	
   534	    Every batch -- the trailing short one included -- is computed at exactly
   535	    ``--batch-size`` rows (see :func:`pad_batch`), so a query's recorded values do not
   536	    depend on how many queries shared its batch; ``meta.batch_canonical`` records that.
   537	
